
# The `view` head in the CODE role: a component, with nothing held back. State, events, effects and native calls
# are all reachable from one, because a component is code we wrote and reviewed.
#
# `view` is the head in BOTH roles and the role decides the authority. In the `view` role it PLACES a component
# and defines only the document, and a document cannot define one because its file is in the other role. That is
# the security model stated as one sentence. See note/term/view/06-mill.md.
#
# Was spelled `zone` until 2026-08-30. `deck/zone/` is the environment and secret system and shares nothing with
# this but the old name, which is why the name had to move.

load @term/mill/code/code/take/mine
  find take

load @term/mill/code/code/hook/mine
  find hook

load @term/mill/code/code/tune/mine
  find tune

load @term/mill/code/code/note/mine
  find note

mine view
  mine list
    mine form, like view-def
      site view

mine view-def
  mine term, term view
    mine term
      site name
    mine list
      mine form, like take
        site take
    mine list
      mine form, like hook
        site hook
    mine list
      mine form, like tune
        site tune
    mine list
      mine form, like view-def
        site view
    mine maybe
      mine form, like note
        site note
